# Dart sources are text, always. A test that needs a NUL byte in a fixture can
# write one as a literal, and git's binary heuristic then calls the whole file
# binary: the diff collapses to "Binary files differ" with no line counts, so
# nobody reviews it. Escape sequences are the fix in the source; this makes the
# diff readable even when a file slips through.
*.dart text diff
